',
  '<p class="gd-p">Your day, in order: handovers, returns, deliveries, moves and photo shoots. Each job card has the car, the plate, the place and the time.</p><section class="gd-task" id="my-jobs-your-job-list" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Your job list</h2><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--side"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">The menu: <b class="gd-ui">My jobs</b>, <b class="gd-ui">My hours</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Report a problem</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Add a rental</b>, <b class="gd-ui">My sales</b> and <b class="gd-ui">Me</b> (Referrals, Profile and Academy, as a row on top). <b class="gd-ui">Sign out</b> is top right.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Switch between <b class="gd-ui">Today</b> and <b class="gd-ui">Tomorrow</b>. Jobs are in time order.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">The next job is the big card at the top: its time and how long until it, the car and its plate, the place with <b class="gd-ui">Open in maps</b> and a button to call the renter, and what to put in the car. The rest of the day follows in time order.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">A handover or a return has its own button: <b class="gd-ui">Check out (pickup)</b> or <b class="gd-ui">Check in (return)</b>. One tap acknowledges and starts the job and opens its photo checklist. Other jobs: press <b class="gd-ui">Open the job</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">5</span><div class="gd-t">Moving a car that has no job? Use Vehicle moves (see below).</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--phone"><div class="gd-phone"><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:390/1530"><img src="/guides/img/field-01-today-phone-b31e25fb.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="390" height="1530"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:91%;top:15%" aria-hidden="true">1</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:89.7%;top:53.3%" aria-hidden="true">2</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:89.7%;top:61.4%" aria-hidden="true">3</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:89.7%;top:88.2%" aria-hidden="true">4</span></div></div></figure></div><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Tip</span><div>Need help on a job? Call CarmaCars at 289-312-5991. The link is at the bottom of My jobs.</div></aside></section><section class="gd-task" id="my-jobs-open-a-job" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Open a job</h2><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--side"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">The card shows the kind, the time, the car, the plate and colour.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">The address, with <b class="gd-ui">Open in maps</b> for directions, and a button to call the renter.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">For a handover: the booking, the renter&#39;s name and phone, the Card on File and the licence on file.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Acknowledge</b> so the office knows you have it. Then press <b class="gd-ui">Start</b> when you are with the car.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--phone"><div class="gd-phone"><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:390/1530"><img src="/guides/img/field-02-job-phone-c6780f54.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="390" height="1530"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:94.9%;top:34%" aria-hidden="true">1</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:94.9%;top:44.1%" aria-hidden="true">2</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:94.9%;top:52.6%" aria-hidden="true">3</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:94.9%;top:95.8%" aria-hidden="true">4</span></div></div></figure></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="my-jobs-check-the-renter-s-licence" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Check the renter&#39;s licence</h2><p class="gd-p">The renter&#39;s licence photos and selfie are checked before the handover. You can check them yourself, for a booking on one of your own jobs today or in the next 7 days. Everything you do is recorded with your name and &quot;field staff&quot;.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">My jobs shows <b class="gd-ui">Licences to check</b> when the licence front, back or selfie of a renter on one of your jobs waits for a decision. The same check is on the job itself, under <b class="gd-ui">Check the licence</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Review the licence</b>. The images open with the name, date of birth and licence details on the booking.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Look at each image: the name and date of birth match the booking, class G2 or G and valid past the return date with no sign of alteration, and the selfie matches the licence photo.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">One is wrong? Open <b class="gd-ui">Reject this one</b> under it, type the reason the renter reads and press <b class="gd-ui">Reject</b>. The renter is told why and sends a new one.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">5</span><div class="gd-t">Then press <b class="gd-ui">Approve all</b>: everything still waiting is approved at once.</div></li></ol></div><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Tip</span><div>The renter&#39;s proof of coverage stays with the office. Meeting the renter at the handover? You can still check the original licence in person from the ready check (see A handover).</div></aside></section><section class="gd-task" id="my-jobs-move-a-car" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Move a car</h2><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Under Vehicle moves, press <b class="gd-ui">Start a move</b>. Choose the Car and Why (for example Reposition).</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Fill in From and the Odometer (km), then press <b class="gd-ui">Start the move now</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">When you arrive, press <b class="gd-ui">End the move</b>, fill in Now at and the odometer, then press <b class="gd-ui">End the move now</b>.</div></li></ol></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="my-jobs-documents-to-sign" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Documents to sign</h2><p class="gd-p">Your staff agreement, when CarmaCars sends it.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">My jobs shows &quot;You have a document to sign&quot;. Press <b class="gd-ui">Read and sign</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Check the key values at the top (your role, wage and start date), then press <b class="gd-ui">Read the PDF</b> and read it.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Sign in a few steps: press <b class="gd-ui">Send the code</b> and type the 6-digit code from your phone or email, tick that you read it, draw your initials beside the key terms (confidentiality, the rules on money, keys and cars, ending the agreement), tick the two consents and draw your signature.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Sign</b>. The signed copy, with its certificate of completion, stays on the same page.</div></li></ol></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="my-jobs-cars-now" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Cars now</h2><p class="gd-p"><b class="gd-ui">Field work</b> &gt; <b class="gd-ui">Cars now</b> shows which cars are out, coming back today and tomorrow, going out in the next 72 hours and free, with no money. The renter&#39;s phone shows only on your own jobs.</p></section>');
select app.guide_release_section('field', 'academy', 'chapter', 'my-hours-and-pay', 'Your training path is under **Field work** > **Academy**: the handover, the return, cash and signing in the field, and the rules of the trip.

